{
  "draughtsman": "0",
  "graph": "graph.json",
  "batch_axis": 0,
  "title": "Convolutional VAE",
  "subtitle": "{model.params} parameters · {model.input_shape} in, reconstruction out",
  "stages": [
    {"id": "image", "name": "image", "kind": "input", "nodes": ["in1"],
     "detail": ["{stage.out_shape}", "channels × height × width"]},
    {"id": "enc", "name": "strided conv encoder", "kind": "conv",
     "nodes": ["n0020", "n0021", "n0028", "n0029"],
     "detail": ["stride {node:n0020.constants.stride[0]}, halving twice",
                "{stage.out_shape}", "{stage.params} params"]},
    {"id": "flat", "name": "flatten", "kind": "op", "nodes": ["n0032"],
     "detail": ["{stage.out_shape}"]},
    {"id": "mu", "name": "mean", "kind": "op", "nodes": ["n0035"],
     "detail": ["{stage.out_shape[1]}-dim latent", "{stage.params} params"]},
    {"id": "sigma", "name": "log-variance → σ", "kind": "op",
     "nodes": ["n0038", "n0040", "n0041"],
     "detail": ["{stage.out_shape[1]}-dim", "{stage.params} params"],
     "note": "The half-and-exponentiate is the trace of exp(0.5·logvar); the scale factor is a literal in the source, not a parameter."},
    {"id": "noise", "name": "ε ~ N(0, I)", "kind": "input", "nodes": ["n0047"],
     "detail": ["{stage.out_shape}"],
     "note": "A source node with no data ancestor. graph.json records its input as the mean, because randn_like reads the mean's SHAPE — the values never flow. The edge drawn here follows the model, not the trace."},
    {"id": "sample", "name": "reparameterise", "kind": "concat",
     "nodes": ["n0048", "n0050"],
     "detail": ["μ + σ ⊙ ε", "{stage.out_shape}"]},
    {"id": "lift", "name": "project and reshape", "kind": "op",
     "nodes": ["n0053", "n0059"],
     "detail": ["{stage.out_shape}", "{stage.params} params"]},
    {"id": "dec", "name": "transposed-conv decoder", "kind": "conv",
     "nodes": ["n0074", "n0075", "n0082"],
     "detail": ["stride {node:n0074.constants.stride[0]}, doubling twice",
                "{stage.out_shape}", "{stage.params} params"]},
    {"id": "recon", "name": "reconstruction", "kind": "output", "nodes": ["n0083"],
     "detail": ["sigmoid", "{stage.out_shape}"]}
  ],
  "edges": [
    {"from": "image", "to": "enc"},
    {"from": "enc", "to": "flat"},
    {"from": "flat", "to": "mu"},
    {"from": "flat", "to": "sigma"},
    {"from": "noise", "to": "sample", "style": "dashed"},
    {"from": "mu", "to": "sample"},
    {"from": "sigma", "to": "sample"},
    {"from": "sample", "to": "lift"},
    {"from": "lift", "to": "dec"},
    {"from": "dec", "to": "recon"}
  ],
  "caption": "A fork into two sibling heads and a rejoin that takes in a tensor from outside the graph. Coverage checks that every operation is placed; it does not check that the edges drawn are the edges traced."
}
